      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To begin the process in the Admin Office, first check if it has started."
      ],
      "justification": "The start node, initial framing action, and condition-check action all derive from the opening unit. Modeling the condition as an action step and adding structural/init plumbing preserves behaviour."
